            "detailed_description": "<h1>Roteiro</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/33c66880ce5729d5233ea833dbf2cc96.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1080 height=1445 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Funnel Runners</strong>, where you will have your first on-site deployment with APEX Storm Monitoring Services. <br><br>A high-priority F5 tornado is approaching, and we are counting on <strong>you (and up to 7 fellow friends)</strong> to <strong>collect data, scavenge necessary information</strong>, and, of course, <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/06dcb0607fcde2708e741762632b798b.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The weather is your worst enemy here. <strong>Tornados and storms will spawn randomly</strong>, <strong>grow stronger</strong> over time, and <strong>tear the whole map apart</strong>. Buildings will collapse piece by piece, and items will no longer be found in destroyed areas, so you must adapt quickly.  <strong>Be careful not to be swept up by the wind; you may not be found again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this mission, you can <strong>team up with 7 other players or tackle it solo</strong>. <strong>Share gadgets, split up</strong> to cover more ground, <strong>collect necessary information and items</strong> to <strong>fix the van</strong> before the situation turns bad. <br><br>With <strong>realistic graphics and a first-person perspective</strong>, the experience brings you close to every gust of wind, distant siren, and falling piece of debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge the collapsing city for scattered <strong>vehicle parts, fuel, and tools</strong>. These items will allow you to <strong>repair your van and help you survive the storm</strong>. Each playthrough features <strong>randomized environments, weather, items, and problems to solve on your vehicle</strong>. No playthrough will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/2d9ada22e06ded7538b4462ad55b68f3.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/12ffbd50ea0de88b33354f78e1d5547a.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Funnel Runners</strong>, where you will have your first on-site deployment with APEX Storm Monitoring Services. <br><br>A high-priority F5 tornado is approaching, and we are counting on <strong>you (and up to 7 fellow friends)</strong> to <strong>collect data, scavenge necessary information</strong>, and, of course, <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/06dcb0607fcde2708e741762632b798b.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/c06104d47ae20dceb1725c5841197c9b.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The weather is your worst enemy here. <strong>Tornados and storms will spawn randomly</strong>, <strong>grow stronger</strong> over time, and <strong>tear the whole map apart</strong>. Buildings will collapse piece by piece, and items will no longer be found in destroyed areas, so you must adapt quickly.  <strong>Be careful not to be swept up by the wind; you may not be found again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/8e91c7b074b5de90a4dabc5d2af175eb.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this mission, you can <strong>team up with 7 other players or tackle it solo</strong>. <strong>Share gadgets, split up</strong> to cover more ground, <strong>collect necessary information and items</strong> to <strong>fix the van</strong> before the situation turns bad. <br><br>With <strong>realistic graphics and a first-person perspective</strong>, the experience brings you close to every gust of wind, distant siren, and falling piece of debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.poster.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.webm?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/f258c2e1b3a067b6d5f5bf8f057ee484.mp4?t=1792610681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge the collapsing city for scattered <strong>vehicle parts, fuel, and tools</strong>. These items will allow you to <strong>repair your van and help you survive the storm</strong>. Each playthrough features <strong>randomized environments, weather, items, and problems to solve on your vehicle</strong>. No playthrough will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/426d7d785b01866611c513cc2eff14fd.webp?t=1792610681\" width=1400 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712080/extras/2d9ada22e06ded7538b4462ad55b68f3.avif?t=1792610681\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
